          "type": "text",
          "text": "Code2000 is a Unicode-based TrueType font striving to eventually represent all of the extended characters and symbols assigned to Unicode in a consistent typeface.\r\nIts developer has tried to create a distinctive style or flavor for the characters while remaining faithful to the classic letter forms of the various scripts."
